   {
    "_key": "en",
    "value": [
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "855c3b206155",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "d09e969a07a5",
        "text": "The administration of the forrestresort.com.ua website undertakes to protect your privacy on the Internet. We attach great importance to protecting the data you provide. Our privacy policy is based on the requirements of the General Data Protection Regulation of the European Union (GDPR). The purposes for which we collect personal data: improving the operation of our service, contacting visitors to this website, providing services related to the activities of this website, as well as for the following actions.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "ac55bd9e2063",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "85816dbf93c1",
        "text": "Collection and use of personal data",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "d125bd2b5a15",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "73a585ab9149",
        "text": "We collect and use your personal data only with your voluntary consent. By giving this consent, you allow us to collect and use the following data: first and last name, email address, phone number. Your data is collected and processed in accordance with the laws in force in the European Union and in Ukraine.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "c66964eece5f",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "ef6966a77f4a",
        "text": "Data storage, modification and deletion",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "52352522af16",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "725e7ceb257b",
        "text": "A user who has provided their personal data to the forrestresort.com.ua website has the right to have it modified and deleted, as well as to withdraw their consent to its use. The period for which your personal data will be stored: 90 days. When the use of your data ends, the website administration deletes it. To access your personal data, you can contact the website administration at the following address: forrestresort.com@gmail.com. We may transfer your personal data to third parties only with your voluntary consent; if the data has been transferred, we cannot change it in other organisations associated with us.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "623f3db44f70",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "9bcfaaa4e0d6",
        "text": "Use of technical data when visiting the website",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "84a96cb9f1db",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "7ccc94226555",
        "text": "When you visit the forrestresort.com.ua website, the database stores records of your IP address, time of visit, browser settings, operating system and other technical information necessary for the website content to be displayed correctly. This data cannot be used to identify the visitor.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "459218f228ab",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "3ca6344c8f4a",
        "text": "Information provided by children",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "519c27041f04",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "0bd2bb683b41",
        "text": "If you are a parent or guardian and you know that your children have provided us with their personal data without your consent, contact us: forrestresort.com@gmail.com. Our service prohibits leaving personal data of minors without the consent of their parents or guardians.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "59a7c8f6830a",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "cd9a4b97ab7f",
        "text": "Use of cookies",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "d95194859244",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "089c3fd4d2c2",
        "text": "To display the website content correctly and to make the forrestresort.com.ua website convenient to use, we use cookies. These are small files stored on your device. They help the website remember information about you, for example, in which language you view the website and which pages you have already opened; this information will be useful on your next visit. Thanks to cookies, browsing the website becomes much more convenient. You can read more about these files here. You can configure your browser to accept or block cookies yourself. Being unable to accept cookies may limit the functionality of the website.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "0d90a2a9759d",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "7cfff88f9d88",
        "text": "Use of personal data by other services",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "9358dbd50f73",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "0fb4a6c4e215",
        "text": "This website uses third-party online services that collect information independently of us: Google Analytics, Facebook.com. The data they collect may be shared with other services within these organisations, and they may use the data to personalise advertising in their own advertising network. You can read the user agreements of these organisations on their websites. We do not transfer personal data to other organisations and services not specified in this privacy policy. The only exception is the transfer of information upon lawful requests of state authorities authorised to carry out such actions.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "debfe6c53963",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "b7de95f46046",
        "text": "Links to other websites",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "6cb80d183e42",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "69d6b2154d00",
        "text": "Our forrestresort.com.ua website may contain links to other websites that are not operated by us. We are not responsible for their content. We recommend that you read the privacy policy of each website you visit, if it has one.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "c193d02e8618",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "6ed077e7bcca",
        "text": "Changes to the privacy policy",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "8d357821a40a",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "1f469dbd5581",
        "text": "Our forrestresort.com.ua website may update our privacy policy from time to time. We announce any changes by posting the new privacy policy on this page. We monitor changes in legislation concerning personal data in the European Union and in Ukraine. If you have left your personal data with us, we will notify you of a change in the privacy policy. If your personal data was entered incorrectly, we will not be able to contact you.",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "a3bcc6b44375",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "b4a0481d290b",
        "text": "Feedback, final provisions",
        "marks": []
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "7bde1e754406",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
       {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "16d332ec38bd",
        "text": "You can contact the administration of the forrestresort.com.ua website on matters related to the privacy policy at: forrestresort.com@gmail.com, or using the contact form in the relevant section of this website. If you do not agree with this privacy policy, you may not use the services of the forrestresort.com.ua website; in this case, you must refrain from visiting our website.",
